    <briefdescription>
<para>Exports a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_base_entity_set" kindref="compound">BaseEntitySet</ref></computeroutput> in JSON-LD or RDF format. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><heading level="3">JSON-LD</heading>
</para>
<para>Uses a <computeroutput>@context</computeroutput> that maps common entity types to schema.org and juris (<ulink url="https://juris.bundesrecht.de/vocabulary/">https://juris.bundesrecht.de/vocabulary/</ulink>) terms.</para>
<para><heading level="3">RDF</heading>
</para>
<para>Produces a minimal but valid Turtle or N-Triples document using the <computeroutput><ulink url="https://themisdb.io/legal/">https://themisdb.io/legal/</ulink></computeroutput> base IRI. Entity properties are mapped to <computeroutput>rdfs:label</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>dc:identifier</computeroutput>, and <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethemis" kindref="compound">themis</ref>:property</computeroutput> predicates.</para>
<para>All output is deterministic given the same input (stable sorting). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
